1. `put_str` is defined in `artifact/gguf_reader_test.cpp`. It appends a string to a byte vector:

```cpp
void put_str(std::vector<uint8_t>& b, const std::string& s) {
    put<uint64_t>(b, s.size());
    b.insert(b.end(), s.begin(), s.end());
}
```

It writes the string's length as a `uint64_t` followed by the raw bytes of the string.

